{"id":"auch","lemma":"auch","pos":"adv","rank":39,"glosses":["also, too, as well (in addition to whatever or whoever has previously been listed)","To confirm a preceding statement by someone else: really, actually, indeed, in fact","To ask for confirmation of something one considers necessary."],"ipa":"/aʊ̯x/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f8/De-auch.ogg/De-auch.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich habe auch einen Bruder.","en":"I also have a brother.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/698675","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"brother"}]},{"text":"Bist du auch neu?","en":"Are you new, too?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/195775","words":[{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"new"}]},{"text":"Willst du auch gehen?","en":"Do you want to go, too?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/757315","words":[{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to go, to walk"}]},{"text":"Arbeiten Sie auch dort?","en":"Do you work there, too?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756332","words":[{"g":"to work"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null,{"g":"there, yonder"}]},{"text":"Ich wollte es auch wissen.","en":"I also wanted to know.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755871","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to know"}]}]}